{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_3000_situation", "source_sha256": "ac7e4d413418fb8817f907a97d65f00072cd2e812c693fd3e53106bb73ef6dba", "ja": "グラビア撮影のお仕事", "zh": "写真摄影的工作", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_3000_place", "source_sha256": "dc2eab181b21579d24af8758a5c8880d3a25c4048161584a8837b0a8c92754ca", "ja": "控え室", "zh": "准备室", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_3001_011ami", "source_sha256": "3941e27b4969790b2c4bb23a2b689348a8fd46eac656499f15f3d6d6fea986f8", "ja": "今日は雑誌のお仕事だね、兄ちゃん！\n亜美はゲージュツのためなら、水着もヘッチャだよ♪", "zh": "今天是杂志的工作呢，大哥哥！\n亚美只要是为了艺术，就算要穿泳装也不算什么♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_3002_p", "source_sha256": "7b78c808f9516d5e88087ad08550b8aa06847a8e8aba76a90b115a2389c88093", "ja": "その姿勢は感心だけど、\n今回は水着撮影じゃないぞ、亜美。", "zh": "你的态度让人很欣慰，\n但这次并不是要拍摄泳装喔，亚美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_3003_011ami", "source_sha256": "582f4fe9c39a844aaa2264c5cde1118f0366ec81d335084599fc643e794fcd21", "ja": "え～。亜美、メッチャのり気だったのに～。\n女にハジかかせると、モテないよ？", "zh": "欸～亚美超有干劲的说～\n让女孩子蒙羞，可不会受欢迎喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_3004_p", "source_sha256": "54b6a8235df4892b42682e08c4a696d9b6c2a22b22e2a47c3b7087fa024645b3", "ja": "誰に聞いたんだ、そんな台詞……。とにかく、\n今日のグラビアのテーマは、亜美の新しい一面だ。", "zh": "那种话你是听谁说的……总之，\n今天写真的主题是亚美的新的一面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_3005_p", "source_sha256": "6f73fe4ebe3f86a728367b6cfb5d07fd23e3d20675c591759cf1676f32634533", "ja": "つまり亜美のファン達に、亜美の素顔を\n教えてあげよう、って企画なんだよ。", "zh": "也就是说，这个企划是要让亚美的粉丝们\n看到亚美的本色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_3006_011ami", "source_sha256": "949bef2885e4141514576366d9fd3559f8bb2d1bb59798345f6ab118341c976f", "ja": "イエッサー！　つまり、ファンの兄ちゃんたちに\n亜美のホントの姿を見せちゃおうってコトだね！", "zh": "Yes，Sir！也就是说，让粉丝的大哥哥们\n看到亚美真正的样子对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_3007_011ami", "source_sha256": "e67d0db8434c282b90a5ef0f59d059ce45492288c3ffabb94e6d5f1e81b5c80b", "ja": "でも、亜美のホントの顔かぁ……。ねね、兄ちゃんは、\nワイルドとエレファント、どっちだと思う？", "zh": "不过，亚美真正的模样啊……喂喂，大哥哥\n觉得亚美属于Wild型还是Elephant型？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_3008", "source_sha256": "819262c7151c753f69ea8dc1e99e767bfa273d2a00d7d5469d2001c6d3041218", "ja": "ワイルド", "zh": "Wild", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_3009", "source_sha256": "13cb1cdd7bd52fde1332bddfe99b4f6517165e0fb6577a527f6f6893b8b43956", "ja": "エレ…エレガント", "zh": "Ele……Elegant", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_3200_p", "source_sha256": "137b8bf8392709c03e5c793a6633ffce8437bf6ec3159afc1fae3561a33c8e73", "ja": "やっぱり、ワイルドじゃないか？", "zh": "果然是属于Wild型吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_3201_011ami", "source_sha256": "305e5ae3244232e6dcea71fa61a199775bbe4db544108c04d7cb6a8cdc9e732a", "ja": "おおっ、兄ちゃんもそう思う？\nうんうん、亜美ほどキケンな女はいないもんね～♪", "zh": "哦哦，大哥哥也这么想？\n嗯嗯，毕竟没有像亚美这么危险的女性了嘛～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_3202_011ami", "source_sha256": "dac528cb6339fadabe0bf03d227309799e58cbbb72a2f5d2c3cb816824dc65e2", "ja": "ワイルド＆デンマークな亜美の魅力で、\nみんなのシセンをヌカ漬けにしてみせるよー！", "zh": "亚美会用Wild＆Denmark的魅力，\n让大家看得眼睛忘记转圈圈喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_3203_p", "source_sha256": "61652e98280d8b8dd3563743f7c7e519e34442ed032caab2819ba7f37fbdf136", "ja": "ああ、どっぷり漬けこんでやろう！", "zh": "嗯，让粉丝被你迷得目不转睛吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_3300_p", "source_sha256": "137b8bf8392709c03e5c793a6633ffce8437bf6ec3159afc1fae3561a33c8e73", "ja": "やっぱり、ワイルドじゃないか？", "zh": "果然是属于Wild型吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_3301_011ami", "source_sha256": "2f5a838968743541de65629949eaf9c58649e692e8a0fed11f1748bfe2f47231", "ja": "わかったよ兄ちゃん♪　こう見えて亜美、\nワイルドにはちょっとくわしいかんね！", "zh": "亚美知道了，大哥哥♪你可能看不出来，\n其实亚美对Wild可是有点研究的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_3302_011ami", "source_sha256": "aea4c4e511c8edd5412398cbed962a9a540421c07be7a8a1e6c1d3ddd5681e24", "ja": "じゃ、今回の衣装は、熊の毛皮とー、石のオノとー、\nあとコシミノね！　んっふっふ～、ワイルドせくし～♪", "zh": "那今天的服装就穿上熊的皮草～手拿石斧～\n再搭配草裙！嗯哼哼～真是Wild又Sexy～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_3500_p", "source_sha256": "df49547efb74a7e893a8b85cb85eb4fd35f6018404834b9206f220242efdd21e", "ja": "思いきってエレファ……\nエレガントじゃないか？", "zh": "完全是Eleph……\nElegant型吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_3501_011ami", "source_sha256": "88972c75316637bdfdb21e206c7d626145821e8187c4f3e6961c7572aa92ab5f", "ja": "うんうん、わかってるね、兄ちゃん♪　そう、オトナに\nなった亜美は、すっかりエレファントの似合う女……！", "zh": "嗯嗯，你很懂呢，大哥哥♪没错，成长的亚美，\n已经完全是个与Elephant相符的女人了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_3502_011ami", "source_sha256": "99f6140160596c70795f5993cea3eba080c6ebb0c0544a1c3290b2b30f4a3965", "ja": "んじゃ、亜美に似合うオトナ衣装、いっぱい選んでね！\nすらっとしたスカートとかー、すらっとした鼻とかー♪", "zh": "好啦，要挑选很多适合亚美的成熟服装喔！\n比如修长的裙子～或是修长的鼻子～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_3600_p", "source_sha256": "df49547efb74a7e893a8b85cb85eb4fd35f6018404834b9206f220242efdd21e", "ja": "思いきってエレファ……\nエレガントじゃないか？", "zh": "完全是Eleph……\nElegant型吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_3601_011ami", "source_sha256": "ca871c17d1a953a5c719c483ca4543c5aca57a86c72e0d46961bfe22378183a1", "ja": "うんうん、エレファント……つまりお嬢様っぽい\nカンジだよね♪　んじゃ、高笑いの練習からスタート！", "zh": "嗯嗯，Elephant……也就是像千金小姐的感觉对吧♪\n好啦，开始来练习大笑吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_3602_011ami", "source_sha256": "5d8e75e6fbf3c26d171f9481c5b4677f23afeef6292a289b64e5bd58e52ae183", "ja": "ぱお～っ、ぱおぱおぱおぱおぱお！\nゾウでございますゾウ！　…あれ、どしたの兄ちゃん？", "zh": "叭哦～叭哦叭哦叭哦叭哦！\n是大象喔大象！……咦，你怎么了，大哥哥？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
